    "chunk_text": "\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0da2\u0dd3.\u0da2\u0dd3. \u0db8\u0db4\u0dc0\u0db1\u0dca\u0db1\u0dda\u0db6\u0dbd\u0dda \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bc7\u0bc0.\u0bc7\u0bc0. \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0ba9\u0bae\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc8\u0bae\u0bcd) (The Hon. G.G. Ponnambalam) Hon. Presiding Member, at the very outset, I wish to thank the Hon. Nalin Bandara Jayamaha from the SJB for giving five minutes of his time for me to speak today. I truly appreciate that because this Bill with regard to the Office for National Unity and Reconciliation is something that specifically concerns the Tamil people, especially the people of the North and the East and there are a few matters that I wish to raise. So, in that regard, I truly do appreciate the Hon. Member for giving me his time.\n\n119 120\n\n[\u0d9c\u0dbb\u0dd4 \u0dd2\u0dbd\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dca \u0daf\u0db4\u0daf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dba\u0dcf \u0db8\u0dc4\u0dad\u0dcf]\n\n2024 \u0da2\u0db1\u0dd9\u0dcf\u0dd2\u0db8 2\n\nThe irony is, bringing in the Office for National Unity and Reconciliation Bill, the sort of comments the Minister of Justice\u2019s made this morning alone, in my view, Sir, are enough for us to vote against this Bill and that is what we are going to do. We will be calling for a Division and will be voting against this Bill.\n\nBut, Sir, that is not the only reason for our decision. What is the context in which this Bill is being brought? There have been talks. The Hon. President announced to the whole world that he is going to find a negotiated solution to the Tamil national question. He first said, before the Independence Day; soon after he became"
